xray-exporter
=============

This product includes code and design derived from
github.com/batonogov/xray-health-exporter, which is licensed under the MIT
License:

    Copyright (c) 2025 Федор Батоногов

Specifically:

  - the approach in internal/xrayproc of running xray-core as a linked Go
    library and replacing the supplied config's `log` and `inbounds` sections
    rather than appending to them;
  - the idea of verifying egress (internal/egress): comparing the address an
    IP-echo endpoint sees through the config's tunnel with the address it sees
    on a direct request, because a config's own `routing` rules can otherwise
    send probe traffic out directly.

